<Base>
  <h4> Howdy! I'm Rob, an engineer, aspiring paragliding pilot, and avid outdoorsman. </h4>

  <p>
      I've spent ~5 years in autonomous aviation, most recently leading the Detect and Avoid program at <a href="https://reliable.co/"> Reliable Robotics</a>. 
      <br>
      In my free time, I paraglide (competition, hike & fly races, cross country), <a href="http://portfolio.barlowr.com">make things</a>, take pictures, and write a bit.
  </p>
  <br />
  <div id="definition">
      <i>peregrination ( perəɡrəˈnāSH(ə)n ) <b>n.</b></i>
      <p>-    1, A journey, pilgrimage; <i>fig.</i> the human journey through life;</p>
      <p>-    2. A long trip in which you travel to various different places, especially on foot</p>
  </div>
</Base>
